WEBVTT

0
00:00:01.100 --> 00:00:04.460
Sprezzature is an AI engine for Design.

1
00:00:04.660 --> 00:00:06.900
This one is about interfaces.

2
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:11.625
A sentence typed straight
into a page costs nothing today.

3
00:00:12.600 --> 00:00:15.787
It costs a week the day
you need a second language.

4
00:00:20.400 --> 00:00:23.360
Here, every sentence lives
in one catalogue.

5
00:00:24.600 --> 00:00:28.520
So the same screen changes language,
and the design holds.

6
00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:32.800
English, French, German. Nothing moves.

7
00:00:40.400 --> 00:00:44.212
The audit finds every sentence
that belongs in the catalogue.

8
00:00:45.400 --> 00:00:49.600
Then it stops, and lets the author decide.
It never guesses.

9
00:00:52.400 --> 00:00:54.900
The same care goes into every component.

10
00:00:56.600 --> 00:01:00.787
One family of typefaces, visible focus,
and a dark mode that works.

11
00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:11.200
Star it on GitHub,
and find the suite on sprezzature.ai.

12
00:01:11.600 --> 00:01:14.360
Make it, audit it, take a look at it.
